{"title":"Fairy","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 10 Fae that attacks with shock (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/fae-bowstring\">Fae Bowstring</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/quality-and-enchanting\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Underleaf\">Underleaf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 9 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Underleaf%20Silver%20Mine\">Underleaf Silver Mine</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"fairy\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Fae: <a href=\"#/monster/fae\">Fae</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/gossamer-knight\">Gossamer Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(46)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/glamourweaver\">Glamourweaver</a> <span class=\"muted\">(48)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/summer-queen\">Summer Queen</a> <span class=\"muted\">(52)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/4c228ba127838c2b2a3e.webp\" alt=\"Fairy\"></div><h3>Fairy</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>10</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 10)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Fae</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>shock · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>31</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>10</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>2.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>6 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}